# Fluxo completo do sistema, pelo gateway.
# Abra no VS Code com a extensão "REST Client" (humao.rest-client) e clique em "Send Request"
# em cada bloco, de cima para baixo. Os tokens dos logins são reaproveitados nas chamadas seguintes.

@gateway = http://localhost:8080
@email = ana@insper.edu.br
@password = 123456
# o mesmo ADMIN_EMAIL / ADMIN_PASSWORD do docker/.env
@adminEmail = admin@pma26.local
@adminPassword = troque-pela-senha-do-env

### Health-check (rotas abertas)
GET {{gateway}}/auth/health-check

###
GET {{gateway}}/accounts/health-check

### 1. Registrar usuário (aberta) -> 201 | 409 se o email já existe
POST {{gateway}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ana",
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### 2. Login (aberta) -> 200 {"jwt": "..."} | 401
# @name login
POST {{gateway}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### 3. Rota protegida SEM token -> 401
GET {{gateway}}/accounts/qualquer-id

### 4. Token inválido -> 401
GET {{gateway}}/accounts/qualquer-id
Authorization: Bearer token-invalido

### 5. Login com senha errada -> 401
POST {{gateway}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "senha-errada"
}

# --- RBAC -------------------------------------------------------------------

### 6. User tentando listar todas as contas -> 403 (só admin)
GET {{gateway}}/accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.jwt}}

### 7. Login do admin -> 200 {"jwt": "..."} (token com role "admin")
# @name adminLogin
POST {{gateway}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{adminEmail}}",
  "password": "{{adminPassword}}"
}

### 8. Admin lista as contas -> 200 (cada uma com o seu "role")
# @name contas
GET {{gateway}}/accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.jwt}}

### 9. User vê uma conta: a própria -> 200; a de outra pessoa -> 403
# troque pelo id da Ana (resposta do passo 8) para ver o 200
GET {{gateway}}/accounts/{{contas.response.body.$[0].id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.jwt}}

### 10. User tentando apagar uma conta -> 403
DELETE {{gateway}}/accounts/{{contas.response.body.$[0].id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.jwt}}

### 11. Header forjado não adianta -> 403 (o gateway reescreve os headers de identidade)
GET {{gateway}}/accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.jwt}}
role-account: admin
